Source qualification after detailed comparison read: a category column left
unticked alongside an explicit status note is not an omitted table row. The
Weschle comparison calls its small stochastic-label differences trivial but
states that their cause is not established; this reception does not relabel
them as proven Monte Carlo noise. Audit keys mean the authors' inputs at
their actual join stage, including their own preceding transformations, before
any checker-added normalization or correction.

## Author override after reception (2026-11-27, 08:15 annotations)

The author ruled finding3 independently of12/1570. This supersedes the
historical exit criterion requiring3/12 to be ruled together and the earlier
held disposition for3; original logs and criterion text remain as history.
A check asserted without numbers or code is eligible and cannot be rejected
as a duplicate on that basis; propose it when it bears on the main result.
The signer may reject it for another explicit reason; proposal is not
mandatory execution. Child1574 implements the harness probe wording and
files the same wording to the receiver-owned panel prompt. The actual prompts
are in replicator's frozen paper folders, not in the harness. Preserve those
frozen artifacts and request correction in future/reusable prompts.

For1/2, the author specified two binding lines in reproduce (one per audit),
pointing to a detailed reference. The checklist includes keys as coded, match
rates/unmatched-key samples, encoding/quotes/whitespace/case, many-to-many,
duplicate keys, constructed missingness, and a text-versus-code table format.
Paper cases remain in replicator. Child1573 retains this exact placement.

The clause unaudited joins imply no Fully is expressly a proposal for
canonical review, not adopted. Current assessment.md defines execution Fully
through complete required matching comparisons; missing join audit is not
a separate category condition. Audit evidence will be reported separately;
no category downgrade is introduced via evidence wording. Findings4/5/10/12
and general signing authority remain held.

Additional child1574: harness eligibility/proposal wording and ticket-only
foreign prompt handoff. Parent1572/1552 remain open, and remote prompt pickup
will be reported as pending until the receiver verifies completion.
